        "TileImage": "$($repository 41956eaf-82da-46c4-ae02-0953c3df5a58).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47. Your target is Carlton Smith, if that name rings a bell, that&apos;s because he used to be a field agent for the ICA, now he works for Interpol. We fear that he may potentially leak classified information and considering his track record, it&apos;s inevitable. He&apos;s located at the GAMA facility in Hokkaido, but even though we looked at the CCTV footage thoroughly, we don&apos;t have any more details on his location, so you&apos;ll have to find him on-site. Good luck, 47.",
